  "Time left": "剩餘時間",
  "Tilt your device to move around the map and head for the exit tile.\nThe gauge in the corner shows your tilt: dashed ring to walk, solid ring to run.": "傾斜裝置即可移動，前往出口地磚。\n角落的指示器顯示傾斜程度：超過虛線圈走路，超過實線圈奔跑。",
  "Stepping on this tile will reverse the controls.\nStep on another and they go back to normal.": "踩到這塊地磚會反轉操作。\n再踩一塊就會恢復正常。",
  "Stepping on this tile will make Map Man disappear.\nDon't worry, after a few moves he will show up again.": "踩到這塊地磚，Map Man會隱形。\n別擔心，走幾步他就會再次現身。",
  "Stepping on this tile will cause Map Man to get stuck.\nShake your device to free him and get moving again.": "踩到這塊地磚，Map Man會被困住。\n搖一搖裝置就能讓他脫困，繼續前進。",
  "Watch out for bonus points,\nalthough you may have to go out of your way to get them.": "留意獎勵分，\n不過要拿到它們可能得繞遠路。",
  "Also keep an eye out for extra lives,\nbut take care as they will take you\neven more off course than bonus points.": "也要留意額外生命，\n不過要小心，為了拿到它們\n你得繞的路比獎勵分還遠。",
  "Be careful of the poison tiles: if you step on them you will lose a life.": "小心毒地磚，踩到就會失去一條生命。",
  "These tiles crumble away once you step off them.\nThere is no going back, so plan the way ahead.": "離開這些地磚後，它們就會碎裂掉落。\n沒有回頭路，所以請提前規劃路線。",
  "Spikes rise and fall on a beat, with a warning first.\nWait for them to drop, then cross before they rise again.": "尖刺會先發出警示，然後有節奏地升降。\n等它們落下後再通過，趕在再次升起之前。",
  "Ice sends you sliding until a plain tile or the edge stops you.\nYou can't steer on it, so line up before you set off.": "踩上冰面會一直滑行，直到被普通地磚或邊緣擋住。\n滑行時無法轉向，所以出發前先對準方向。",
  "These tiles will give you extra time or cost you time. You will get bonus points for time left on the clock when you finish each level.": "這些地磚會增加或減少你的時間。每關結束時，剩餘時間會換算成獎勵分。",
  "These tiles cause other tiles to disappear and reappear. When the tiles are hidden you can still step on them so remember where they are.": "這些地磚會讓其他地磚消失再重現。地磚隱藏時仍然可以踩，所以要記住它們的位置。",
  "Every so often you'll come across a checkpoint. Each time you reach a checkpoint you can restart from there instead of going back to the beginning.": "你會不時遇到檢查點。每到達一個檢查點，就可以從那裡重新開始，而不必回到起點。",
  "Tap the screen during play to pause. Holding your device a new way? Tap the corner gauge to set that as the new centre.": "遊戲中點一下螢幕即可暫停。換了握持姿勢？點一下角落的指示器，即可將目前角度設為新的中心。",
  "You're all set, head for the exit to start the game. Have fun!": "一切就緒，前往出口開始遊戲吧。玩得開心！",
